# pgvector

Open-source vector similarity search for Postgres.

Supports exact and approximate nearest neighbor search, L2 distance, inner product and cosine distance, and works with any language that has a Postgres client.

Example:

    CREATE EXTENSION vector;
    CREATE TABLE items (id bigserial PRIMARY KEY, embedding vector(3));
    INSERT INTO items (embedding) VALUES ('[1,2,3]'), ('[4,5,6]');
    SELECT * FROM items ORDER BY embedding <-> '[3,1,2]' LIMIT 5;

Indexing is supported through HNSW and IVFFlat.
